#X text 870 890 THE MAP: every cell is a latent point z \, coloured by the favourite that dominates the mix there - pale cells are blends \, the GAN's new presets. It is redrawn every 50 training steps. The black dot is you., f 56;
#N canvas 40 60 1240 820 map 0;
#X text 20 10 THE MAP OF THE LATENT SPACE: for each of the 10 x 10 cells \, ask the generator for its mixing weights at the cell centre and colour the cell by the favourite with the biggest weight - pale = a blend. Then count how many favourites own at least one cell (80% or more): the favourites the GAN can play. Missing ones = mode collapse., f 168;
